        "published_at": "2026-07-26T15:06:07Z",
        "draft": false,
        "prerelease": false,
        "body": "## Which one should I download\n\n#### Normal version (Recommended)\n- [x64 (Most common)](https://github.com/PhoenixNil/XrayUI-dev/releases/download/1.18/XrayUI-win-x64.zip) | [ARM64](https://github.com/PhoenixNil/XrayUI-dev/releases/download/1.18/XrayUI-win-arm64.zip)\n\n#### Self-contained WinAppSDK version (larger; use only when the normal version fails to start)\n- [x64](https://github.com/PhoenixNil/XrayUI-dev/releases/download/1.18/XrayUI-win-x64-wasdk.zip) | [ARM64](https://github.com/PhoenixNil/XrayUI-dev/releases/download/1.18/XrayUI-win-arm64-wasdk.zip)\n\n\n## What's Changed\n* feat: preserve VLESS-XHTTP mode/extra from import to config and share link by @PhoenixNil in https://github.com/PhoenixNil/XrayUI-dev/pull/97\n* Add unit tests for the parser layer by @PhoenixNil in https://github.com/PhoenixNil/XrayUI-dev/pull/98\n* support Xray log level and dnsLog setting by @PhoenixNil in https://github.com/PhoenixNil/XrayUI-dev/pull/99\n* Infer default routing region on first run by @PhoenixNil in https://github.com/PhoenixNil/XrayUI-dev/pull/101\n* Replace default title bar icons with custom icons by @PhoenixNil in https://github.com/PhoenixNil/XrayUI-dev/pull/103\n* Fix mini window restoring to full size when moved after maximize by @PhoenixNil in https://github.com/PhoenixNil/XrayUI-dev/pull/104\n* Improve log rendering by @PhoenixNil in https://github.com/PhoenixNil/XrayUI-dev/pull/105\n* Refine log viewer rendering by @PhoenixNil in https://github.com/PhoenixNil/XrayUI-dev/pull/107\n* Fix invisible scroll thumb in log window by @PhoenixNil in https://github.com/PhoenixNil/XrayUI-dev/pull/108\n* Improve mini window text display and optimize batch latency test sorting by @PhoenixNil in https://github.com/PhoenixNil/XrayUI-dev/pull/109\n* Add hysteria2 port hopping and certificate pinning by @PhoenixNil in https://github.com/PhoenixNil/XrayUI-dev/pull/110\n* Add subscription usage and bulk refresh by @PhoenixNil in https://github.com/PhoenixNil/XrayUI-dev/pull/114\n* Show subscription group and favorite marker in server detail pane by @PhoenixNil in https://github.com/PhoenixNil/XrayUI-dev/pull/115\n* Add per-subscription scheduled auto-refresh by @PhoenixNil in https://github.com/PhoenixNil/XrayUI-dev/pull/116\n* Confirm updates with release notes; drop the in-app geo update button by @PhoenixNil in https://github.com/PhoenixNil/XrayUI-dev/pull/118\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/PhoenixNil/XrayUI-dev/compare/1.17...1.18",
